### Pré-requisitos: rode http/users.http (cria o analista analyst@example.com com UFs SP e DF)
### e http/solicitations.http (deixa uma solicitação SUBMITTED na variável "solicitation_id", UF RJ)

### Login como ANALYST (guarda o token em "analyst_token")
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "analyst@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("analyst_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Solicitação fora da cobertura (RJ não está em SP, DF) -> 404
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Id inexistente -> 404 (mesma resposta de "fora da cobertura")
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Dica: para testar o caminho feliz, no solicitations.http use um CEP de SP (ex.: 01310-100)
### ou atribua RJ à cobertura do analista com PUT /admin/users/{id}/coverage

### Iniciar análise -> 200, status IN_REVIEW
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Iniciar de novo -> 409
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

### Decidir com comentário curto -> 400
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "APPROVE",
  "comment": "ok"
}

### Aprovar -> 200, status APPROVED
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "APPROVE",
  "comment": "Documentação conferida e aprovada"
}

### Decidir de novo -> 409
POST {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}/decide
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{analyst_token}}

{
  "decision": "REJECT",
  "comment": "Mudei de ideia sobre esta solicitação"
}

### CLIENT não acessa as rotas do analista -> 403
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{client_token}}

### Sem token -> 401
GET {{host}}/analyst/solicitations/{{solicitation_id}}
